<section><h2 class="ref-sec-title">Events</h2><ol class="day-events yr-events"><li class="tih-event-card tih-has-thumb"><a class="tih-event-thumb" href="/encyclopedia/baldwin-iii-of-jerusalem" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/baldwin-iii-of-jerusalem.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="168" height="112"></a><div class="tih-event-main"><p class="tih-event-year"><a href="/today-in-history/august-22">22 August</a></p><h3 class="tih-event-title">Baldwin III takes Ascalon from Fatimid Egypt</h3><p class="tih-event-desc">After a siege begun in January, the Fatimid fortress of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/ashkelon">Ascalon</a> surrendered to an army of crusaders, <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/knights-templar">Templars</a> and Hospitallers under King <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/baldwin-iii-of-jerusalem">Baldwin III of Jerusalem</a>. It had been the last coastal city in <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/palestine">Palestine</a> outside crusader control.</p><div class="tih-tags"><a class="tih-tag enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/baldwin-iii-of-jerusalem">Baldwin III of Jerusalem</a><a class="tih-tag enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/kingdom-of-jerusalem">Kingdom of Jerusalem</a><a class="tih-tag enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/fatimid-caliphate">Fatimid Caliphate</a></div></div></li></ol></section>
